---
import ModernLayout from '../../layouts/ModernLayout.astro';
---
<ModernLayout title="About the Practice | Donovan Family Dentistry" description="Learn about the care approach, patient experience, and Lowcountry setting of Donovan Family Dentistry.">
  <section class="modern-page-hero">
    <div class="modern-shell modern-page-hero__grid">
      <div><p class="modern-kicker">About the practice</p><h1>Local care with service at its foundation.</h1></div>
      <p class="modern-page-hero__aside">This page explains the practice experience and what patients can expect. Dentist biographies and staff profiles are consolidated on the Team page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="modern-section">
    <div class="modern-shell">
      <div class="modern-section__head">
        <p class="modern-eyebrow">What guides the experience</p>
        <h2>Useful information, calm communication, and a clear next step.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="modern-value-grid">
        <article class="modern-value-card"><div class="modern-value-icon">01</div><h3>Clear communication</h3><p>Patients deserve practical explanations, understandable options, and time to ask questions before deciding on care.</p></article>
        <article class="modern-value-card"><div class="modern-value-icon">02</div><h3>Comfortable visits</h3><p>A friendly team, organized process, and calm environment help reduce uncertainty from check-in through follow-up.</p></article>
        <article class="modern-value-card"><div class="modern-value-icon">03</div><h3>Lowcountry connection</h3><p>The practice serves families on Lady's Island, throughout Beaufort, and across the surrounding Lowcountry community.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="modern-section modern-section--sea" aria-labelledby="about-journey-heading">
    <div class="modern-shell">
      <div class="modern-section__head">
        <p class="modern-eyebrow">A practical patient journey</p>
        <h2 id="about-journey-heading">The website should make common tasks easier.</h2>
        <p>Instead of repeating the same biographies and service lists, each page now has one job.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modern-card-grid">
        <article class="modern-card"><h3>Before the visit</h3><p>Find office hours, directions, downloadable forms, and the right phone number without searching through several pages.</p></article>
        <article class="modern-card"><h3>Understanding care</h3><p>Use the Services page for the complete published procedure list and the Team page for provider and staff information.</p></article>
        <article class="modern-card"><h3>Getting help</h3><p>Use the Contact page for general administrative questions while keeping medical and insurance details out of an unsecured web form.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="modern-section">
    <div class="modern-shell modern-visit-grid">
      <article class="modern-visit-card">
        <p class="modern-eyebrow">Serving Lady's Island</p>
        <h2>Close to Beaufort, easy to find, and built around local access.</h2>
        <p>The practice is located at 91 Sams Point Road. Directions, hours, forms, and contact options remain available from every page.</p>
        <div class="modern-actions"><a class="modern-button modern-button--primary" href="/modern/contact/">Contact and directions</a><a class="modern-button modern-button--secondary" href="/modern/services/">Explore services</a></div>
      </article>
      <aside class="modern-visit-card">
        <h3>Looking for the dentists?</h3>
        <p>Provider biographies and the full patient-care team are now together on one page.</p>
        <div class="modern-actions"><a class="modern-button modern-button--secondary" href="/modern/team/">Meet the team</a></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</ModernLayout>
